\description{
Play-by-play of a game (2016-17 onward): every shot, rebound, foul, turnover, substitution and time-out.

One row per event. \code{play_type} is the API's event code and \code{play_name} its bundle name
(\code{acb_codes.PLAY_TYPES}; a code outside the table, such as the minute marker 600, has no name);
\code{turnover_type} decodes \code{play_tag}. The clock counts DOWN: \code{minute} / \code{second} are the time left in the
period and \code{clock_seconds} the same in seconds. \code{order} is not unique (the starting five share one);
\code{play_index} is the 1-based position in the feed. \code{is_home} is true for the home team's events (the feed's
\code{local}). \verb{run_*} columns are the acting player's running box score AFTER the event. Games before 2016-17
answer no events (the wrapper raises \code{hoopR_no_data}).

Endpoint: \verb{GET https://api2.acb.com/api/matchdata/PlayByPlay/play-by-play}
}
